     "startSeconds": 960.04,
     "endSeconds": 990.08,
     "textPreview": "系统阻尼比就是你的减震器如果阻尼比很小呢那就说明减震器坏了当汽车压过减速带的频率",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-9c541f3aa2bc9db1fe6a6c02",
       "matchedLabel": "阻尼比",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 24,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 37,
     "startSeconds": 990.08,
     "endSeconds": 1015.2,
     "textPreview": "在系统里疯狂累积哇物理学上的共振那反用在褒的浮频弧上原来平划的曲点似就会在转折频",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:v11g-9c541f3aa2bc9db1fe6a6c02",
